{
  "program": "CBTRN03C",
  "caseId": "case01",
  "description": "The whole happy path for a single in-range transaction, end to end. Proves the eight report records app/cbl/CBTRN03C.cbl produces for one record and their exact order: 1120-WRITE-HEADERS (:324-341) emits REPORT-NAME-HEADER, WS-BLANK-LINE, TRANSACTION-HEADER-1 and TRANSACTION-HEADER-2 because WS-FIRST-TIME is 'Y' at :275; FUNCTION MOD(WS-LINE-COUNTER, WS-PAGE-SIZE) at :282 is MOD(4,20) and so breaks no page; 1120-WRITE-DETAIL (:361-374) emits the detail line; and the end-of-file arm at :197-203 emits REPORT-PAGE-TOTALS, its trailing TRANSACTION-HEADER-2 and REPORT-GRAND-TOTALS. Every record is the 133 bytes app/jcl/TRANREPT.jcl:78 declares. RETURN-CODE stays 0 because the program moves nothing to it.",
